 {\"type\": \"integer\", \"required\": true, \"location\": \"path\"}, \"candidate_id\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"description\": \"Filter to messages for a specific candidate.\", \"location\": \"query\"}}, \"response\": \"{messages: [MailboxMessage, ...]}\", \"url\": \"https://api.recruitee.com/c/{company_id}/recruitee/v1/c/{company_id}/mailbox/messages\"}], \"count\": 5}"
